Hi {{firstName}},

I saw {{company}} is hiring for {{role}} and wanted to reach out directly rather than disappear into the applicant pool.

{{hook}}

Two things that might be relevant:
- [Proof point 1 — a result with a number in it]
- [Proof point 2 — most relevant experience for this role]

I'm a UAE National, so my hire also counts toward {{company}}'s Emiratisation targets — but I'd rather earn the role on merit; happy to walk you through my work in 15 minutes.

Best,
{{myName}}
{{headline}}
{{linkedin}} | {{phone}}

Dear {{firstName}},

I'm an Emirati professional ({{headline}}) exploring {{role}} opportunities at {{company}}.

Beyond the fit for the role itself, I understand hiring UAE Nationals is a priority — my hire counts toward your MoHRE Emiratisation targets, and Nafis support (salary top-up and employer pension contribution) applies.

{{hook}}

Would you be open to a short call this week, or could you point me to the right hiring manager?

With thanks,
{{myName}}
{{linkedin}} | {{phone}}

Hi {{firstName}},

Following up on my note from a few days ago — I know inboxes are brutal.

One line on why I'm worth 15 minutes: {{hook}}

If someone else owns this hire, a quick redirect would be hugely appreciated.

Best,
{{myName}}

Hi {{firstName}},

Last note from me — I'll assume the timing isn't right and won't clutter your inbox further.

If a {{role}}-shaped need comes up later, my details are below and I'd genuinely love to talk. Either way, thanks for reading.

Best,
{{myName}}
{{linkedin}} | {{phone}}

Hi {{firstName}},

I just applied for the {{role}} opening at {{company}} (application under {{myName}}) and wanted to introduce myself directly.

{{hook}}

I'm also a UAE National, which I understand is relevant for {{company}}'s Emiratisation goals. If it's useful, I'm happy to share a short summary of exactly how I'd approach the first 90 days in this role.

Best,
{{myName}}
{{headline}}
{{linkedin}} | {{phone}}

Hi {{firstName}},

Hope you're well! I'm applying for {{role}} at {{company}} and saw you're connected there.

{{hook}}

Would you be comfortable referring me, or introducing me to the hiring manager? Happy to send a short blurb + CV to make it zero-effort. And of course, tell me if it's awkward — no pressure at all.

Thanks either way,
{{myName}}
